{"op":"add","key":"HOP-3","patternType":"unwanted-behavior","systemName":"memory_search","trigger":"an entity scope matches no active memory","systemResponse":"fall back to unscoped results silently","negated":true,"priority":"medium","status":"implemented","verificationMethod":"test","verificationNote":"SHIPPED. An entity scope matching nothing returns NO hits and says so through `scope_empty` (apps/mcp/src/tools.ts); the scope never widens. Silent widening would lie about provenance, so an empty scoped result is visibly empty."}

